            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 3,
              "start": 3
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Shay Dvoretzky (Petitioner), according to Shay Dvoretzky (Petitioner), the case centered on whether the Foreign Sovereign Immunities Act bars suits against foreign officials for actions taken on behalf of their foreign state."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Kennedy",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "22ceb54e65f01626776cfb7f0ecf6bd9e1b8af1edc60c36d44eb3ba7be4bcf84",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-22ceb54e65f0-0000-0002"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 4,
              "start": 4
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Kennedy asked the petitioner, \u201cWhat authority do you have for that?\u201d"
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Ginsburg",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "22ceb54e65f01626776cfb7f0ecf6bd9e1b8af1edc60c36d44eb3ba7be4bcf84",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-22ceb54e65f0-0000-0003"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 5,
              "start": 5
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Ginsburg asked whether any Alien Tort Statute or torture statute would survive because the Foreign Sovereign Immunities Act provides no exception."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Alito",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "22ceb54e65f01626776cfb7f0ecf6bd9e1b8af1edc60c36d44eb3ba7be4bcf84",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-22ceb54e65f0-0002-0000"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 41,
              "start": 41
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Alito asked if the petitioner agreed with the Solicitor General\u2019s position about preserving pre\u2011existing immunities."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Stevens",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "22ceb54e65f01626776cfb7f0ecf6bd9e1b8af1edc60c36d44eb3ba7be4bcf84",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-22ceb54e65f0-0003-0000"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 63,
              "start": 63
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Stevens asked whether the petitioner contended that his client was covered by 1603(b)(1)."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Scalia",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "22ceb54e65f01626776cfb7f0ecf6bd9e1b8af1edc60c36d44eb3ba7be4bcf84",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-22ceb54e65f0-0001-0000"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 21,
              "start": 21
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Scalia asked whether there was any uncertainty about individuals."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Scalia",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "22ceb54e65f01626776cfb7f0ecf6bd9e1b8af1edc60c36d44eb3ba7be4bcf84",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-22ceb54e65f0-0001-0001"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 24,
              "start": 24
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Scalia asked whether a \u201cno\u201d answer would essentially decide the case."
      }
    ],
